{
  "id": "p06",
  "title": "The Corner Bakery",
  "titleZh": "街角面包店",
  "topic": "家庭与街区",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My dad keeps a small bakery before dawn every day.",
        "zh": "我爸爸每天天亮前都守着一家小面包店。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My aunt comes at six to bake the fresh bread.",
        "zh": "我姑姑六点就来烤新鲜的面包。"
      },
      {
        "en": "There is an old factory near our quiet little corner shop.",
        "zh": "我们安静的小店旁边有一座老工厂。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our little bakery sits on East Road near the green park.",
        "zh": "我们的小面包店坐落在东路上，靠近绿色的公园。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The government has a new plan for our small and narrow street.",
        "zh": "政府为我们这条狭窄的小街制定了一个新计划。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Another plan may force us to move away next early spring.",
        "zh": "另一个计划可能会迫使我们明年早春搬走。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He will not close his small family business this year.",
        "zh": "他今年不会关掉自己的小家族生意。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A careful officer checks the long green form and slowly nods.",
        "zh": "一位细心的官员检查了那份长长的绿色表格，慢慢点了点头。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The second page is completely blank and badly torn now.",
        "zh": "第二页完全空白，而且被撕得很严重。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The picture by the door looks like an old photograph.",
        "zh": "门边的那幅画看起来像一张老照片。"
      },
      {
        "en": "This is a fine example of honest, patient, steady work.",
        "zh": "这是诚实、耐心、踏实工作的一个很好的例子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the early morning, fresh food arrives from the farm.",
        "zh": "清晨时分，新鲜的食物从农场运到这里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Twelve neighbors wait outside, and seventeen tired workers arrive.",
        "zh": "十二位邻居在外面等着，十七位疲惫的工人也到了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "In the afternoon, bright yellow flowers fill the front window.",
        "zh": "下午，明黄色的花摆满了前面的橱窗。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A tall glass jar takes the small space by the door.",
        "zh": "一个高高的玻璃罐占了门边那块小地方。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We prepare a modern wooden sign above the front door.",
        "zh": "我们在前门上方准备了一块现代风格的木牌。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The small shop will remain open until midnight again tonight.",
        "zh": "这家小店今晚会再次营业到午夜。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Maybe a new start is not truly impossible after all.",
        "zh": "也许重新开始对我们来说并非真的不可能。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then nature gives us this wonderful, quiet evening air.",
        "zh": "于是，大自然又给了我们这个美好、安静的傍晚空气。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "He is too busy to sleep, but still quite determined.",
        "zh": "他忙得没时间睡觉，但依然十分坚定。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A city businessman offers to buy our little bakery shop.",
        "zh": "一位城里的商人提出要买下我们的小面包店。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Neither plan works, and either choice is very hard today.",
        "zh": "两个计划都行不通，而任何一种选择都非常艰难。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A wool jacket hangs beside an old brown tie.",
        "zh": "一件羊毛夹克挂在一条旧棕色领带旁边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My nose is red, and my left ear hurts a lot.",
        "zh": "我的鼻子红了，左耳也疼得厉害。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A tall mirror from abroad hangs on the back wall.",
        "zh": "一面来自国外的镜子挂在后墙上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A blind old man plays a guitar outside the shop.",
        "zh": "一位失明的老人在店外弹吉他。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His loud song makes the lonely street feel warm and bright.",
        "zh": "他响亮的歌声让这条孤独的街道变得温暖又明亮。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later the existing sign is complete and bright at last.",
        "zh": "后来，那块原有的招牌终于做好了，亮堂堂的。"
      }
    ]
  ],
